							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "heading",
							"settings": {
								"title": "Ken's note",
								"header_size": "p",
								"_css_classes": "eyebrow"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "5e1dc6e",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>A Signature journey is not the most places we can fit into your dates. It is the fewest places that make the trip make sense.</p>\n<p>The routes that lasted are the ones where the third day is quiet. Everybody remembers the arrival and the finale; what decides whether the journey worked is what happened in the middle, and that only works with room in it.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__body"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "452cdd4",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>Ken FJ Her — founder, Brother Tours. Licensed Lao National Tour Guide since 2010; founded Brother Tours in 2018.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__attribution"
							},
